+    entry_mode="stdin",
+    class_name=None,
+    method_name=None
+):
+```
+
+**Behavior:**
+- 3 required parameters (solution_path, brute_path, generator_path)
+- 7 optional parameters with defaults
+- Returns: string (plain-text report)
